    "detailed_description": "You are a knight of the Order, but you have been sent to a Deadly Arena by an unknown magic, do your best and try to escape.<br />\r\nYou will face endless waves of enemies, including goblins, skeletons and ghosts.<br />\r\nIn addition to the enemies, the Mortal Arena contains mysteries and challenges to be overcome, you must be careful in some environments.<br />\r\nTo help you, you can choose a skill to use in difficult moments and every 2 waves you can improve your statistics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCommands;<br />\r\nAttack                                          - Left Click<br />\r\nDefend                                         - Right Click<br />\r\nLock and Unlock Camera            - Mouse Scroll<br />\r\nMove                                           - W,A,S,D<br />\r\nCamera                                       - Mouse<br />\r\nRun                                             - Left Shift<br />\r\nHeal                                            - Q<br />\r\nRoll                                             - Space<br />\r\nUse Skills                                    - E<br />\r\nMenu                                          - Enter",
